R.version.string: R version 4.5.2 (2025-10-31 ucrt) 
RNGkind() documented kinds (per ?RNGkind, 'all five ... available in R' in
the manuscript is a selection of these eight, not literally all of them):
  Wichmann-Hill, Marsaglia-Multicarry, Super-Duper, Mersenne-Twister,
  Knuth-TAOCP, Knuth-TAOCP-2002, L'Ecuyer-CMRG, user-supplied
Kinds tested here (the five the manuscript names):
  Mersenne-Twister, L'Ecuyer-CMRG, Wichmann-Hill, Marsaglia-Multicarry,
  Knuth-TAOCP-2002


